Wait wraps ctx.Err() with "jobs: wait: %w" unless errors.Is(err,
context.DeadlineExceeded). ctx.Err() is an Unresolved load inside package context,
which no guard can remove: expected that Unresolved(memory) entry under the fmt.Errorf
link, marked "possibly handled" by the errors.Is guard. No sentinel entries.
-- args --
jobs/jobs.go:@wait
